/* ==================================================================
   Print Yield — leadership page (cube-based, no sheet reads)
   Cube row: [platform, io, region, brand, path2, book, pageCat, group, period, band, channel,
              k, g, rc, rce, arc, arce, pg, n, ins, b, neg, comm, contr, cli, tier]
   k = net earned · g = gross (tier price) · rce = rate card (earned) · pg = pages · n = drops
   comm/contr/cli/tier = bridge amounts (rate card = tier + gross; gross = net + contr + cli + comm)
